 "titulo": "Your first battle as a Roman legionary 🛡️ Part 3 #history #shorts",
 "capa": "SHIELDS UP",
 "descripcion": "Throw the pilum, close the shield wall, stab with the short sword. Survive twenty-five years, and Augustus pays you about thirteen years of salary.\n\nSources: Cassius Dio 55.23; Res Gestae of Augustus.\n\nWould you have lasted 25 years?\n\n#history #ancientrome #romanlegion #historyfacts #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "The enemy is coming, and you stand in a line, shield to shield.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The trumpet sounds. Your centurion shouts. Nobody breaks the line.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At thirty paces, you throw your pilum, a heavy javelin.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Everyone throws at once. Thousands of javelins, in one cloud.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It bends on impact, so nobody can throw it back.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It sticks in the enemy's shields, and drags them down.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then, shields up. Under arrows, you lock into the tortoise.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Shields over your head, shields on every side.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You fight with a short sword, stabbing, not swinging.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You push with the shield, and stab under the ribs.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A short sword needs no space to swing. So the line stays tight.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Every few minutes, the front line rotates, so fresh men fight.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A wound in the back is a disgrace. Nobody runs.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "If a whole unit runs, one man in ten may be executed.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Survive twenty-five years, and Rome pays you a bonus.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "In money, or a plot of land to farm.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "About thirteen years of salary, in one go. Would you have lasted?",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
